      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This entirely is due to world creators not being warned about it, so instead a warning in the SDK explaining that.\nor giving an option to use a prefab to only enable it in desktop.\nI don't think adding yet another option for badly handled effects in edges cases is a good idea considering the issues we already have with misorganized & cluttered settings with the new UI slowly getting proper organization.\nAgain with this type of issue, it's also down to the users in the community to reach out to creators and give feedback via their socials / discord or anything really. This is an issue and any effort from individuals is extremely valuable.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
