  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-11-14T00:19:21.088Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This bug has been persistent for a while and really needs a fix please. Depth of field effect in VR gives a \"Tank top\" mask that breaks the players vision. This makes many maps, including a 2022 Spookality submission: Foreign Story, unplayable.\nPlease allow us to locally turn off Depth of Field like the bloom slider so we have a work around for this effect (or all post processing entirely since it eats a significant amount of performance for just existing).",
